WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.700
The Second Great Collapse has been stopped.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.930
He must have passed the information
to Chihiro and his friends.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.240
I'm so glad.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.730
Now there's no reason for us to fight anymore.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.540
The real battle starts now.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:59.010
The Delicate Flower Bud is Both
Medicine and Poison

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:02.510
Everything will end, and then it will begin.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:07.390
It's time for us to abandon everything
and take our first step into a new world.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:10.900
I've been saving Chiyu for this day.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:15.900
Her wisdom will lead us to victory.

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:18.650
I won't accept another failure, Kark.

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.660
Your false understanding will
bring about your death.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.160
I am your comrade, not your subordinate.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.370
You...

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:31.370
Should we be arguing amongst ourselves?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:36.170
You idiots are fighting the wrong enemy.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.340
Drayle-dono is right.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.430
We should be working to defeat Kamina Chihiro.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:44.730
No!

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:48.860
He killed Aoi Jun and Minakami Haru.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:49.560
What?

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:53.760
Chihiro cut down both of them.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:55.640
You're lying! Chihiro-kun would never—

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:58.240
They're not the only ones.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:01.200
He killed thousands of audience members, too.

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.230
Ignorance is bliss, but it's terribly sinful.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.790
Isn't a father's responsibility
to explain things to his daughter?

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:18.190
We were also wrong to use
the concertgoers as a shield.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:21.760
But they knew that and attacked anyway.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:25.300
It was a display of unbelievable cruelty.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:29.470
This is what you call a worst case scenario.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:34.940
I don't know who told them, but they
must've known this would happen.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:39.870
Kamina Chihiro has begun to
awaken as the Lord of Cruelty.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:42.360
Eventually he will destroy everything.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.390
No. Chihiro-kun wouldn't hurt anybody...

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.150
Drayle took this video.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:53.120
See for yourself.

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.380
The plan was a success.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:03.130
I destroyed the artificial keystone
and stopped the Second Great Collapse.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.720
You were amazing, Chihiro-san.

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.760
You're unstoppable now.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:12.270
But a lot of people died.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.530
Yeah, but...

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.730
It's the Foundation's fault.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.480
If we hadn't stopped them, who knows
what would've happened to Tokyo.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.230
You saved them, Chihiro-san.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:25.080
Kotetsu...

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:28.030
It's all thanks to you.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:31.060
After all, you're the Lord of Vermilion.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.170
What are you talking about?

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:37.490
The last surviving vessel
becomes the Lord of Vermilion.

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.660
Only the last surviving vessel.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:45.330
In other words, my meritorious deeds make <i>me</i>
the best candidate for Lord of Vermilion.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.340
Yeah, but...

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.160
Chihhi's clearly number one.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.190
Th-That's not...

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.430
Dux-sama!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.930
I'm glad he's okay.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.520
It's because Cerdid provided first aid.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:12.500
I was just following Chihiro's orders.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.340
Thanks, Cerdid.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:22.090
Shoko's awful, though.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:26.230
Didn't she leave the both of them
to go destroy the artificial keystone?

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.590
Now she's acting like it was her achievement.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.500
Everyone's different.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:34.310
It's true that she stopped the Great Collapse.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.120
As long as you're okay with it.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.660
I'm sure he'll be surprised

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.900
to learn he was saved by
people he was trying to kill.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:47.780
The smallest thing can
divide enemies and allies.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:52.000
There must have been a way
we could've avoided a fight.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:57.260
Just like he was Akira-san's
friend, Aoi Jun could've been...

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:06.670
Kakihara Isshin    Kurokami Marie    Akaya Inuki    Aoi Jun

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.800
If only that hadn't happened to Inuki-san...

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.490
I'm not so sure.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:06.670
Jun was one twisted dude.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:12.070
He must feel pretty uncomfortable
sitting next to Inuki now.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.750
He wasn't a bad guy.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.570
This is my first time here.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.910
Until now, I've allowed you to handle
everything here without any interference.

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.040
This is...

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.940
This is an impressive recreation.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.990
The seventh artificial
keystone was destroyed.

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:01.000
We can no longer cause a Great Collapse.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:05.080
But if we absorb the ley line
energy at the remaining six

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:10.320
and guide them using this research
equipment, we can forcibly open gates.

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:16.010
However, forcibly opening
gates causes a reaction.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:20.360
When Tokyo's energy balance is
thrown off, it will be destroyed

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.250
and swallowed up by another world.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:24.460
Are you sure?

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.950
Fantastic.

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:29.390
I tried so desperately to bring Mitsuki
back, but it wasn't necessary.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:32.020
I can simply go meet her myself.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:35.610
I don't care if it means destroying
Tokyo or the entire world.

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:36.600
It's trash.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.550
The Foundation, the Heroic
Lineage... It's all trash!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.480
Only you...

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:49.490
Mitsuki, what expression will you make when
I bring all of Tokyo with me to see you?

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:57.980
I know. You'll be surprised, then smile.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.990
You'll know it's exactly the kind of
thing that I—that <i>we</i> would do.

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:08.110
Begin, Chiyu.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:11.510
The fruit of our research is
our reunion on the other side.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.420
Identity verified.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:20.350
Welcome, Professor Mitsuki.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.370
Kamina Chihiro...

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.820
How dare you embarrass me
in front of Dux-sama.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:35.060
You stole my praise out from under me.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:38.900
Such a coward couldn't possibly
be the Lord of Vermilion.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.080
I won't allow it.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:46.350
I stopped the Great Collapse.
I should be the Lord of Vermilion.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.480
How dare he?

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.150
Kamina Chihiro is in my way.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.290
If only he'd disappear...

00:08:56.350 --> 00:09:00.200
Only the last surviving vessel can
become the Lord of Vermilion.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:05.400
Why didn't I notice something so simple sooner?

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:10.320
I'll have to kill Kamina Chihiro and the others.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.180
It's all for Dux-sama.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.040
Then I will be...

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:26.710
Bloody blessings upon your deeds.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:46.120
You're mine!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:52.320
Oh, man. He killed his own allies.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.570
He's merciless.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:58.010
He kills enemies and
allies indiscriminately.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.950
Perhaps he's been seduced by his own power.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:03.340
Don't avert your gaze.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:07.370
Isn't Kamina Chihiro important to you?

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.880
Yahoo!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.820
He knows that thing used to be human.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.160
You're lying... This is a lie!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.460
It's the undeniable truth.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:19.700
No! Chihiro-kun is...

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:23.110
He's no longer the Kamina Chihiro you know.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.670
I understand how you feel.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.980
But he's a victim as well.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:31.370
What?

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:37.380
The more he uses his power, the more
the Lord of Vermilion consumes him.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:42.870
No one can control the power
of the Lord of Vermilion.

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:51.100
He continues to climb the stairway to
destruction without knowing what he's doing.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.840
Eventually his consciousness
will be consumed.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:57.770
He'll simply destroy everything he can.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:10:59.510
It's sad.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:05.010
Save him before he destroys the world.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.860
You're the only one who can do it.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.750
Only me?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:13.800
Stop him from becoming the Lord
of Vermilion and save him.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.270
Only you can do it, Yuri.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:18.330
Save Chihiro-kun?

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:20.450
Save him, Yuri.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:24.030
Bring back the Kamina Chihiro you know.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.530
Save... Chihiro-kun.

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:30.700
That's right, Yuri. Save him.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.660
Me...

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.320
Chihiro-san.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.460
Is this...

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:43.580
Yeah. It's definitely her.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.720
Damn it. Who did this?

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:48.210
Jun and the kid are gone.

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:51.010
The only ones left at the
Foundation are Kark and...

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.490
You're all here.

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:01.320
Since Shoko is gone, I shall tell you.

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:05.480
The agents of Chaos have a new plan.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.530
Why, you...

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.530
What?

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.330
Don't you feel sad at all?!

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:13.500
Haven't you been working together?

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:20.350
They're planning to take all of
Tokyo to another world.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.630
What does that mean?

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.190
What's going to happen to Tokyo?

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:28.590
I'm sure there will be a price to pay.

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:31.000
At best, we'll disappear.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.360
That's not good.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.100
Why are they doing this?

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:35.970
That's meaningless.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:39.860
The only question we should be
asking is if we can stop them.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.570
Should we be stopping them?

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.070
You're the one who ordered us to destroy Tokyo.

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:51.960
Choose your own futures.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.230
The Lord of Vermilion will erase everything.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.470
Even his memories of you.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.380
Before that happens...

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.460
Chihiro-kun...

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:18.340
You seem well, Yuri.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.730
So do you.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.110
I've missed you.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:27.040
I'm sorry, but I...

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.480
It's fine.

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.770
Maldeus Church and the AVAL
Science Foundation can fight,

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:36.380
but that doesn't change our relationship.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.050
Chihiro-kun...

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.390
Want some hot cocoa?

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.440
It's pretty close to the flavor
your mother used to make.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.010
It's good.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:51.720
Really?

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:53.600
Thanks, Yuri.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:58.990
I don't remember my mom's flavor, but
drinking your hot chocolate relaxes me.

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:00.780
That's great.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:04.770
You haven't changed at all. I'm so glad!

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:05.510
Huh?

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:07.250
I was really worried.

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:11.210
I wasn't sure what I'd do if you'd
become someone else.

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:12.760
But I'm glad.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:13.490
Yuri?

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:18.450
I saw a weird vision of you
becoming the Lord of Vermilion.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:23.560
The concertgoers at the Infinity
Theater were turned into monsters,

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:26.280
and with incredible power, you...

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:27.510
I see.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.260
But I couldn't believe it.

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.510
I knew it was impossible.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.270
I knew it was all a lie.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.910
I was fooled by—

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:37.930
It's true.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.770
I killed them. With my hands.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:43.820
Why?

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.030
It's Kark's fault.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:49.000
If he hadn't transformed the concertgoers...

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.280
I had to do it.

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:54.270
I had no choice.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.450
You said you wouldn't let anyone else die.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:59.320
I still feel that way.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:04.210
But to save everyone from the Great
Collapse, I have to get my hands dirty.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.170
That's what I thought.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.850
You had to?

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:12.110
You've changed, Chihiro-kun.

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:12.920
What?

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:17.430
You're not the Chihiro-kun I know.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:22.780
Don't, Chihiro-kun.

00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:25.400
Don't fight anymore.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:27.390
Please!

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:28.920
Yuri...

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:35.080
If you keep using that power,
you'll destroy yourself.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.820
You'll become someone I don't know.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:40.380
I can't stop.

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:43.580
I heard the Foundation is
putting a new plan into motion.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:47.450
Tokyo itself will be swallowed
up by another world.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.770
I'm going to fight.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.920
I took on the dying wishes of
Inuki-san and Kakihara-san.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.870
I can't run now.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.060
Who cares about that?

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.350
What?

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:03.320
You're the only one I need.

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.030
I'll forget about my father.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.740
You should forget about the Lord of Vermilion.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:10.360
But Yuri...

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.860
Let's abandon everything and go
someplace no one will find us.

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:19.220
Somewhere no one can reach us. Just you and me.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.290
Okay?

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.850
I can't do that.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.140
Chihiro-kun...

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.860
I'm sorry, Yuri.

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:31.910
No. Don't do it.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:37.550
I have to save him.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:40.800
I will save Chihiro-kun!

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:41.980
Yuri.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.810
Only I can stop you!

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:48.570
So I...

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.820
Don't hurt Chihiro!

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:04.100
Don't bother.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:07.960
What are you doing?!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.250
Stop, both of you!

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:13.260
Yuri!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:16.510
Give up, Yuri.

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:19.670
Stay out of my way.

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:22.520
I've been hoping this day would come.

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.510
This is your fault.

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:27.730
Chihiro changed since you came along.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:30.980
Leave me alone.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:34.170
He began to treat me coldly.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:38.340
He valued his time with you
more than fighting.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:43.120
Chihiro's risking his life!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.910
But what if you distract him?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.630
What if something happens to him?

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:51.450
I'm a Defender.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.130
Protecting my master is my duty.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:59.050
Yuri, eventually you'll cause Chihiro's death.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:03.080
I'm sorry, but I'd give my life to stop you.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:05.410
That's not...

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:08.650
You also just want to be
with Chihiro, don't you?

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:11.310
I will kill you.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:13.810
I don't care if Chihiro hates
me for the rest of his life.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:17.650
I don't care if he looks at me
with resentment forever.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:18.660
You...

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:21.420
Don't, Cerdid!

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:25.120
Stop! That's an order!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.750
I'm sorry, Chihiro!

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:30.790
No...

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:35.630
Stop!

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:42.580
What?

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.140
Huh?

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.640
What?

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.020
Cerdid!

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:54.520
Chihiro...

00:18:58.190 --> 00:18:59.990
Cerdid!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.410
No...

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:07.120
N-No. This wasn't...

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.010
Yuri, why?

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:12.110
I didn't do anything.

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.380
Chihiro-kun...

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:18.200
I wanted to save you.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.090
Yuri!

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:27.100
Why? Why?

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:31.600
I can't do this anymore.

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:34.730
Let's begin.

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:37.940
All artificial keystones activated.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.710
Ley line energy absorption bulb open.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.110
Limiter removed.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.490
Contact.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.570
Dirac value rising.

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:59.050
Encroaching on dimensional barrier.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:20.190
The destruction is finally starting!

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.680
The land I yearn for is on the other side.

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:28.080
Now is the moment I finally approach.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:55.820
Chihiro-san.

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:57.580
Guys...

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.270
Where's Cerdid?

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:08.660
It's just us now, but we still have work to do.

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:10.290
That's right.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:14.800
The center of the phenomenon
is the research equipment

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.460
at the AVAL Science Foundation HQ.

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:21.200
The equipment that took your
mother from you, Kamina Chihiro.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:22.920
Got it.

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:28.300
Heaven helps those who help themselves.

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:31.230
I hope all's well that ends well.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.330
Right, Chihiro-san?

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:36.080
Let's go, everyone.
